sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Owner (UI or CLI)
  participant C as agent_vault zome
  participant ADM as Admin API
  participant CLI as Agent runner
  O->>C: revoke_agent_token(token_id, reason)
  C->>C: query own chain -> AgentToken.grant_action_hash
  C->>C: delete_cap_grant(grant_action_hash)
  C->>C: create_entry(TokenRevocation{token_id, reason}) + AccessEvent{Revoked}
  O->>ADM: revoke_app_authentication_token(token) (optional, closes app socket)
  CLI->>C: fetch_bundle(token_id)
  C-->>CLI: Err: capability check fails (grant deleted)
  Note over O,CLI: Revocation stops FUTURE reads only.<br/>Values already injected stay in the running process:<br/>rotate the upstream credential (rotate_config_bundle + provider-side rotation).
  O->>C: rotate_config_bundle(config_id, new sealed bundles)
